+//! MacNeutron: the crash handler on Linux (the VM's guest, D3D9 M2b): none. `crash.rs` reads Mach thread state,
+//! `dyld`'s images and macOS's `ucontext`; in the guest a fault goes to Wine's handler and FEX's as any other
+//! library's does, and Wine's own report names the faulting module. ponytail: no Linux report of our own; one comes
+//! when a guest crash needs more than Wine's.
+
+/// Nothing to install on Linux.
+pub const fn install() {}
